{"id": 91644, "field": "description", "ja": "猛禽(bird of prey)は、かぎ爪で敵の\n武器をひったくり、$N1秒間、非武装\n状態にします。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2659"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "非武装状態。"}}
{"id": 91776, "field": "description", "ja": "敵を引っ掻き、通常攻撃の$N1%の\nダメージを与えます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2660"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 91778, "field": "description", "ja": "敵を変形した爪でひっかき、\nターゲットと近くの$N2体に通常\n攻撃の$N1%のダメージを与えます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2661"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 91797, "field": "description", "ja": "敵を猛烈な攻撃で打ち、通常攻撃の\n$N1%を与え、$N2秒間気絶(stun)\nさせます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2662"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "気絶(Stun)状態。"}}
{"id": 91800, "field": "description", "ja": "ターゲットの手足に噛みついて引き裂き、\n$N1秒間、気絶(stun)させ、さらに\nダメージを与えます。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2663"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "気絶(Stun)状態。"}}
{"id": 91802, "field": "description", "ja": "敵に突進し、魔法の詠唱を中断させ、\n$N1秒間、動けなくします。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2664"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 91809, "field": "description", "ja": "ターゲットした敵の背後に跳躍します。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2665"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": []}
{"id": 91837, "field": "description", "ja": "強化する咆哮を解き放ち、$N2秒間、\n受ける全てのダメージを$N1%減らします。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2666"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "被ダメージが$N1%減少。"}}
{"id": 91838, "field": "description", "ja": "身をかがめて防御態勢を取り、$N2\n秒間、全てのダメージを$N1%\n減少させます。ただし、その間、他の\n行動がとれません。", "status": "rejected", "checks": [], "provenance": {"class": "human", "translator": "WoWJapanizer", "source": "ctjt@84db736", "imported": "2026-09-13", "origins": ["ctjt@84db736#2667"]}, "english": null, "reasons": ["no_english_id"], "conflicts": [], "extra": {"short": "被ダメージが$N1%減少。"}}
